# The shift monitor writes its tiered state (warm.sqlite, hot_state.json,
# scratchpads, manifests, forks) into data/ at runtime.
# Deliberately path-scoped, NOT a bare `data/`: every other project in this repo
# has a *tracked* data/ directory holding fixtures.
Build a Multi-Shift Quality Monitoring System with Claude Orchestration/**/data/
